<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4387" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλεπαλληλία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>accumulation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				12.3
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλεπάλληλος</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i>one upon another,
			successive</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥανίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>EM</u>
					702.20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆσσαι</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				982
			</span></i>; <i>cumulative</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύνθεσις</span> (as in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συν-ομ-ήλικες</span>) <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				291.37
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.</span>
			<i>accumulation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				9.39.4
			</span></i>; <i>alternating, varying</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρόμοι</span> Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				331.22
			</span></i>; <i>constantly changing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτελέσματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					243.29
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ως</span>
			<i>in varied style</i>, <i><span class="en">
				272.23
			</span></i>:—also, <i>in layers</i>, of stones, Arg.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
			</span></i>:—perh. to be written divisim <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλ᾽ ἐπ.</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				6.11
			</span></i>.</div>
